  m_text: "Credits\r\n\r\n\r\nDeveloped by\r\n\r\nTranszporterek\r\n\r\nM\xE1t\xE9
    Szomsz\xE9d\r\nR\xE9v\xE9sz P\xE9ter\r\nNagy Rich\xE1rd Bendeg\xFAz\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBackground
    music\r\n\r\n-Glorious morning- by Waterflame (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0)\r\nDestiny Day,
    Mesmerizing Galaxy\r\nby Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\r\nLicensed under CC
    BY 4.0\r\n\r\n\r\nSky\r\n\r\nFree Skyboxes - Space\r\n\r\n\r\nBridges\r\n\r\nCool
    Visual Effects Part 1\r\nEssential 2D Particle FX\r\nRoadside Tales - Free Modular
    Bridge\r\n\r\n\r\nBuildings\r\n\r\nFree Mining Pack\r\nHand Painted Forge\r\nLow
    Poly Farming Game Pack\r\nLow Poly Flying Sci-Fi Island City\r\nLow Poly Urban
    Pack\r\nMedieval Gold\r\nMedieval Windmill\r\nOld Water Well\r\nPandazole Farm
    Ranch Low Poly Pack\r\n\r\n\r\nTrees\r\n\r\nFree Trees\r\n\r\n\r\nVehicles\r\n\r\nSpace
    Shuttle\r\nLowpoly Spaceship\r\n\r\n\r\nTerrain\r\n\r\nLunar Landscape 3D\r\n\r\n\r\nWater\r\n\r\nWaterworks
    - Simple Water/Ocean/River"
